<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA+ rating to Swedish Export's samurai.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA+ rating to Swedish Export's samurai.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Thursday it had assigned an AA+ rating to Swedish Export Credit Corp's 50 billion yen of 5.55 percent yen/Australian dollar dual-currency bonds due November 18, 1999.</p>
<p>The outlook was negative, S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
</text>
